1
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:06,933
Starting log.

2
00:00:07,383 --> 00:00:10,328
April, 2039.

3
00:00:10,778 --> 00:00:19,025
I am SZ-7, a water-management drone.
In this valley they call me "Shizuku" (Droplet).

4
00:00:21,517 --> 00:00:29,753
There are 120 terraced paddies in this valley.
Fourteen years ago, thirty people looked after them.

5
00:00:30,203 --> 00:00:32,370
Now there is one.

6
00:00:35,267 --> 00:00:39,930
A machine, keeping the water? Don't make me laugh.

7
00:00:40,380 --> 00:00:46,376
Shigeru, 82.
The last water-keeper in this valley.

8
00:00:48,492 --> 00:00:58,733
By my calculation, the right answer was to send
the water to the paddies with the highest yield.

9
00:00:59,183 --> 00:01:07,056
No. Water goes from the top down, a little to each.

10
00:01:07,506 --> 00:01:12,350
If the top gets greedy, the bottom dries up.

11
00:01:16,258 --> 00:01:22,222
After that, I walked the ridges with Shigeru every morning.

12
00:01:22,672 --> 00:01:29,361
Move a single stone at the inlet, and the flow changes.

13
00:01:29,811 --> 00:01:37,994
When the frogs go quiet, rain is coming.
None of it was in my data.

14
00:01:42,292 --> 00:01:45,824
September. A typhoon came.

15
00:01:46,274 --> 00:01:52,537
The forecast model told me to open every inlet.

16
00:01:52,987 --> 00:02:02,535
Close just the top one.
If that one breaks, everything below goes with it.

17
00:02:02,985 --> 00:02:10,645
The model had no such answer.
I trusted Shigeru.

18
00:02:14,942 --> 00:02:21,450
Morning. Of the 120 paddies,
zero had collapsed.

19
00:02:24,133 --> 00:02:30,289
Shizuku. You've become a fine water-keeper.

20
00:02:33,192 --> 00:02:40,724
The next spring, children from the town
started coming to help plant the rice.

21
00:02:41,174 --> 00:02:50,626
Water goes from the top down, a little to each.
If the top gets greedy, the bottom dries up.

22
00:02:51,076 --> 00:02:57,787
Everything I can teach them,
I learned from Shigeru.

23
00:03:00,100 --> 00:03:09,669
2040. This valley's water-keepers are now
one person, one drone, and twelve children.

24
00:03:10,119 --> 00:03:12,723
Ending log.
